  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This started since the EAC update. I don't know if there is correlation. I also use the VrChat Creator Companion with ip/info tracked if you can look a little into it with that option I think? Like I say I do not know if there is direct correlation but my mouse has difficulty to follow when the Vrchat/bitdefender/unity are running. Bitdefender seems to find nothing wrong (no infection nothing), Vrchat do not close. and well unity is running pretty mediocre but can work. The 3 application are on heavy load which is normal but they are heavier than normal, expecially bitdefender. I didn't have this problem before this update (EAC). Just wondering if ether vrchat can look into it or someone got a similar problem.",
